Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:03.88,Main,,0,0,0,,DEE is an experimental intelligence technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.15,0:00:10.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It makes it possible to investigate how a system learns, remembers, and changes\Nits responses through experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:12.49,Main,,0,0,0,,This is its application.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.59,0:00:16.82,Main,,0,0,0,,When presented with the same signal, new teaching changes its response.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.89,0:00:21.67,Main,,0,0,0,,The goal is to develop systems that use what they learn during operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:31.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Think of something familiar: we learn an association, remember it, and can revise it\Nwhen new information arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:36.20,Main,,0,0,0,,In DEE, we observe comparable functions through recorded experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.28,0:00:39.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Here, the word “clasifica” is used as a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:42.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Querying it produces a response.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.37,0:00:44.82,Main,,0,0,0,,New teaching is then introduced.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:48.37,Main,,0,0,0,,We query the same signal again, and the response changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:50.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Learning means acquiring that relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.23,0:00:54.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Memory means retaining it and using it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.09,0:00:58.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Plasticity means being able to change how the system works through another\Nexperience.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:04.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The revised response was also observed after saving and reopening the\Napplication.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:08.68,Main,,0,0,0,,What had been learned contributed again, without being taught again in that\Nquery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:16.60,Main,,0,0,0,,How does this happen inside DEE?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:19.53,Main,,0,0,0,,There is a three-dimensional space within the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:24.45,Main,,0,0,0,,The points represent elements of the model; their colors help us follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.65,0:01:27.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Signals can move and meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.91,0:01:33.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Information is transformed in those encounters, and what remains can contribute\Nto another response.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:36.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The engine's rules stay the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.11,0:01:40.34,Main,,0,0,0,,What changes through experience is the organization on which they act.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.41,0:01:46.86,Main,,0,0,0,,That is why the same input can encounter different conditions and produce a\Ndifferent response.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.95,0:01:54.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Now let's see how acquired relationships can be combined.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.45,0:01:59.12,Main,,0,0,0,,It is similar to using two things already learned to obtain a new response.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:06.65,Main,,0,0,0,,In this experiment, the experiences establish two relationships: one increases a\Nvalue by three, and the other increases it by seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:09.95,Main,,0,0,0,,A new query then arrives with a value of twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:16.70,Main,,0,0,0,,At the first encounter, the acquired relationship contributes to a transformation\Nwhose interpreted value is twenty-three.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.88,0:02:20.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The output continues through space and encounters the second relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:22.93,Main,,0,0,0,,The final value is thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.98,0:02:26.20,Main,,0,0,0,,The sum is a simple way to observe the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:32.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What matters is that earlier experiences left relationships that contributed to later\Nencounters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.95,0:02:40.96,Main,,0,0,0,,To establish that contribution, results are compared with controls in which part of\Nthe experience or pathway is removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:47.18,Main,,0,0,0,,This is how composition is studied: one transformation feeds into another within\Nthe same world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.25,0:03:00.12,Main,,0,0,0,,The research also investigates how information can be shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,In communication experiments, a message reached another participant and\Naffected what it did next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.15,0:03:12.28,Main,,0,0,0,,In transfer experiments, a learned relationship traveled and was used again\Nelsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:16.98,Main,,0,0,0,,The interest lies in preserving its function while changing where it is used.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.05,0:03:24.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Remembering also requires access to what has been retained.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:33.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Alternative pathways were tested: after a new access route was taught, a query\Ncould again use previously acquired content.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:38.37,Main,,0,0,0,,The information was still there; what changed was how it could be reached.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:48.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Predictions made before an outcome, and comparisons with what happens\Nafterward, have also been tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:55.42,Main,,0,0,0,,In other experiments, consequences changed a reference and altered a later\Nchoice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:04:03.15,Main,,0,0,0,,The analogy is adjusting our response based on what happened: experience\Ncontributes to the next decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.25,0:04:11.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Another capability is bringing different contributions together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:21.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Organizations were built that combined one hundred and twenty-eight input\Ncomponents, with tests checking each component's contribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:27.98,Main,,0,0,0,,This makes it possible to investigate how information from multiple sources can be\Nintegrated within a single processing mechanism.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:35.12,Main,,0,0,0,,These mechanisms have also been studied together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.20,0:04:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,In a trajectory called APD03, the same organization acquired new associations,\Nretained earlier uses, and used received information to complete tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.10,0:04:56.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we see the course of a recorded task: a request arrives, the required data is\Nobtained, DEE produces a response, and an external tool generates the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:57.18,Main,,0,0,0,,corresponding file.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:05:04.89,Main,,0,0,0,,What matters is being able to follow how learning, access to information, and\Naction contribute to a single history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:17.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What has been built brings together a dedicated engine, reusable experimental\Nmechanisms, and an application for working with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:19.73,Main,,0,0,0,,DEE Universe is the world's engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:26.73,Main,,0,0,0,,DEE thinking provides the tools to prepare experiences, observe responses, and\Npreserve continuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.81,0:05:31.99,Main,,0,0,0,,DEE Cognitive is the application for using the capabilities incorporated into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:37.56,Main,,0,0,0,,This foundation offers resources for research, technical evaluation, and joint\Ndevelopment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:46.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It can provide a starting point for assistants with continuity, systems that adjust\Ntheir responses, or tools for studying learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:51.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Each direction draws on mechanisms already investigated and involves its own\Ndevelopment work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:06:04.02,Main,,0,0,0,,We speak of functional intelligence because of what we observe: acquiring\Nrelationships, remembering, revising responses, combining what has been learned,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:06.03,Main,,0,0,0,,and using information to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:12.86,Main,,0,0,0,,These are functions we associate with intelligent behavior, and DEE makes it\Npossible to study them through experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:22.75,Main,,0,0,0,,The vision is to investigate how organization and experience can give rise to\Ncognitive capabilities, and explore what principles they might share with natural
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:23.16,Main,,0,0,0,,processing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.24,0:06:30.69,Main,,0,0,0,,From Puebla, we seek scientific and technological collaboration to develop this\Nfoundation and measure new possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:32.68,Main,,0,0,0,,DEE Cognitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:35.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Experience changes how the system responds.
